From 6b9d8ca72a639eaee1fe4f2820e0cde9ed317ba6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Heinle <jonasheinle@googlemail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 20:21:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mediafoundation: only detect winapi_app with msvc

gstwinrt calls subdir_done() unless cxx.get_id() == 'msvc', so gstwinrt_dep is
never found with any other compiler. mediafoundation has no such guard, and a
desktop toolchain reports both the DESKTOP and APP partitions, so winapi_app
comes out true anyway. The plugin then requires gstwinrt_dep and errors out, or
quietly disables itself when it is auto.

Use the same condition, so other compilers take the desktop path.

Assisted-by: Claude (Anthropic)
---
 subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/mediafoundation/meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/mediafoundation/meson.build b/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/mediafoundation/meson.build
index 1bd965a..d86230d 100644
--- a/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/mediafoundation/meson.build
+++ b/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/mediafoundation/meson.build
@@ -103,7 +103,7 @@ winapi_desktop = cxx.compiles('''#include <winapifamily.h>
     dependencies: mf_lib_deps,
     name: 'building for Win32')
 
-if runtimeobject_lib.found()
+if runtimeobject_lib.found() and cxx.get_id() == 'msvc'
   winapi_app = cxx.compiles('''#include <winapifamily.h>
       #include <windows.applicationmodel.core.h>
       #include <wrl.h>
